# desc: 공조 구역에서 실을 거쳐 포인트에 이르는 경로는 무엇인가? — 구역 질의와 진단 질의가 만나는 경로
# suite: core
# shared: true
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?zone ?room ?point
WHERE {
  ?zone a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:HVAC_Zone .
  ?zone brick:hasPart|^brick:isPartOf ?room .
  ?room brick:isLocationOf|^brick:hasLocation ?point .
  ?point a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Point .
}
ORDER BY ?zone ?room ?point
